  "stretched_string_hypotheses": "Apply the order-of-magnitude proposal2409.01405: MV=T*LX, T<=cT*M5\u00b2, LX<=Lg, and Lg<=1/KKmin. Then cT>=MV*KKmin/M5\u00b2. Set MV=the repo fitted MU as an additional hypothesis, KKmin1or10TeV as illustrative localization-bound inputs, and export cT sensitivity. No exact black-string prefactor or experimental likelihood is computed; cT is not a measured number. This diagnoses the cost of this particular proposed UV repair, not a theorem excluding all high-scale gauge sectors.",
